      "text": "ALPHABET = sorted('0123456789AQWERTYUIOPSDFGHJKLZXCVBNM')\nfor p in range(5, 36+1):\n    for x in ALPHABET[:p]:\n        for y in ALPHABET[:p]:\n            if int('32', p) * int('14', p) == int(f'{x}{y}2', p):\n                print(int(f'{y}{x}', p))"
